{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "eigh00",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 特征值、对角化与线性动力系统\n\n阅读顺序：**① 特征对象 → ② 相似与对角化 → ③ Jordan、Schur 与矩阵函数 → ④ 稳定性 → ⑤ Markov 长期行为**。\n\n颜色区分知识角色，不表示掌握程度；箭头只保留真正有助于推理的关系。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -260,
      "width": 4130,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "group01",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "1｜特征对象：从方向到代数信息",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1600,
      "height": 1000,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "group02",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "2｜相似与对角化：什么时候能把作用拆开",
      "x": 1700,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 2050,
      "height": 1190,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "group03",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "3｜Jordan、Schur 与矩阵函数：对角化失败之后",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1200,
      "width": 2100,
      "height": 1960,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "group04",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "4｜稳定性：谱怎样控制长期演化",
      "x": 2150,
      "y": 1200,
      "width": 1600,
      "height": 1270,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "group05",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "5｜Markov 长期行为：稳态、唯一性与收敛",
      "x": 2150,
      "y": 2550,
      "width": 1980,
      "height": 1320,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro01",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "先分清三件事：特征向量给出不变方向，特征空间收集同一缩放率下的全部方向，特征多项式从代数上找出可能的缩放率。",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 1520,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro02",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "相似表示同一个线性算子换坐标；对角化则问能否选到一整组特征向量基。判据、计算方法和失败边界分别由不同节点承担。",
      "x": 1740,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 1970,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro03",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "缺少特征向量时，Jordan 链记录缺失方向如何逐层连接；Schur 保留更稳定的数值结构。矩阵幂与矩阵指数把这些结构变成演化公式。",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1250,
      "width": 1970,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro04",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "离散系统看特征值的模，连续系统看特征值的实部。渐近稳定、有界和一条观测轨迹是三个不同问题。",
      "x": 2190,
      "y": 1250,
      "width": 1520,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro05",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "先固定概率向量的行列约定，再区分三个问题：稳态是否存在、是否唯一，以及从任意初始分布出发是否真的收敛。",
      "x": 2190,
      "y": 2600,
      "width": 1900,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "depSchur",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n[[正交矩阵|Orthogonal]] and [[Unitary 矩阵|unitary]] matrices\n\nSquare real or complex isometries preserve lengths during the Schur change of coordinates.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实正交与复酉矩阵都保持长度；方阵条件使换基可逆。",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2490,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "depSVD",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n[[奇异值分解|SVD: input and output bases]]\n\nRead the two-basis definition before comparing SVD with Jordan and Schur forms.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先分清输入、输出两侧基，再比较三种分解各自保留的结构。",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": 2490,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "depNormal",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Normal 矩阵|Normal matrices]]\n\n$A^*A=AA^*$ gives an orthonormal eigenbasis over $\\mathbb C$. If $\\rho(A)<1$, every step contracts in the standard Euclidean length.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Normal 矩阵**\n\n正规性在复数域上提供标准正交特征基；谱半径小于一时，每步在标准欧氏长度下收缩。",
      "x": 2190,
      "y": 2110,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "depFinite",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[有限链平稳分解|Closed-class stationary laws]]\n\nFor a finite chain, one class law per closed class; their convex mixtures give all stationary probabilities. Their linear span is the fixed space.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限链的每个闭类有一个类稳态；凸组合给出全部平稳概率，线性张成给出整个固定空间。",
      "x": 3710,
      "y": 2780,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[特征对|Eigenpair]]\n\n$Av=\\lambda v$ with $v\\ne0$: the matrix acts as scalar multiplication along this direction. A zero eigenvalue is allowed; the zero vector is excluded.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**特征对**\n\n非零向量经矩阵作用后等于自身的标量倍数；特征值可以为零，特征向量不可以为零。",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig002",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[特征空间|Eigenspace]]\n\n$E_\\lambda(A)=\\ker(A-\\lambda I)$ collects the eigenvectors for a fixed scalar together with zero. If the scalar is not an eigenvalue, this space is just $\\{0\\}$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**特征空间**\n\n固定一个标量，把对应特征向量与零向量一起收集；若它不是特征值，所得空间只有零。",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig024",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[特征多项式|Characteristic polynomial]]\n\nFor $n\\times n$ matrix $A$, $p_A(t)=\\det(tI-A)$ is monic of degree $n$. Its roots in the chosen field are exactly the eigenvalues. The alternative $\\det(A-tI)$ differs by $(-1)^n$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**特征多项式**\n\n对 $n\\times n$ 矩阵，首一约定为 $\\det(tI-A)$；当前域内的根就是特征值。另一行列式约定差 $(-1)^n$，零点不变。",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig004",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[代数重数与几何重数|Algebraic and geometric multiplicity]]\n\nRoot repetitions and eigenspace dimension measure different things. For each eigenvalue, the number of independent directions is at least one and at most its root multiplicity.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**代数重数与几何重数**\n\n一个数根重复几次，一个数独立特征方向有几个；后者至少为一，至多等于前者。",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig003",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[特征多项式底层域|Characteristic polynomial and field]]\n\nThe chosen field determines which roots and eigenvectors are available. Extending the field keeps the coefficients unchanged; splitting means every linear factor is available.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**特征多项式的数域**\n\n数域决定可用的根和特征向量。扩域不改系数；完全分裂要求全部一次因子都在当前域中。",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig027",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[互异特征值向量独立|Distinct eigenvalues give independence]]\n\nNonzero eigenvectors of the same matrix, for distinct eigenvalues in the chosen field, form a linearly independent list. Orthogonality is not guaranteed.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**互异特征值向量独立**\n\n同一矩阵、同一数域，互异特征值对应的非零特征向量整体线性无关；不保证正交。",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig005",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[迹与特征值总和|Trace and eigenvalue sum]]\n\n$\\operatorname{tr}A=\\sum_i\\lambda_i$, counting algebraic multiplicity. Real matrices may need complex roots; no diagonalizability is required.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n迹等于按代数重数计入的全部根之和。实矩阵也须允许复根，不要求可对角化。",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[相似矩阵|Similar matrices]]\n\n$B=M^{-1}AM$ with invertible $M$: convert new coordinates to old, apply $A$, then convert back. The same linear action receives a different matrix.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**相似矩阵**\n\n可逆换基先把新坐标送到旧坐标，作用后再换回；同一个线性作用获得另一个矩阵表示。",
      "x": 1740,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig025",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[相似保持特征多项式|Characteristic polynomial under similarity]]\n\n$tI-B=M^{-1}(tI-A)M$. Multiplicativity cancels the determinants of $M$ and its inverse, preserving the whole polynomial.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**相似保持特征多项式**\n\n对移位后的矩阵使用行列式乘法性，换基矩阵与其逆的行列式消去，整个多项式保持不变。",
      "x": 2120,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig043",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[相似保持特征空间维数|Eigenspaces under similarity]]\n\nFor $B=M^{-1}AM$, the map $v\\mapsto M^{-1}v$ bijectively carries $E_\\lambda(A)$ onto $E_\\lambda(B)$. Dimensions agree even though coordinates change.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**相似保持特征空间维数**\n\n$M^{-1}$ 在对应特征空间之间给出可逆的线性对应；坐标会变，维数保持。",
      "x": 2120,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig026",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[同谱不必相似|Equal spectra and similarity]]\n\nEqual characteristic polynomials can hide different eigenspaces. If both matrices are diagonalizable over the same field, the same polynomial is sufficient for similarity.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**同谱不必相似**\n\n相同多项式可能掩盖不同特征空间；若两矩阵都在同一域可对角化，相同多项式则足以推出相似。",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig028",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[对角化|Diagonalization]]\n\nA similarity change makes $S^{-1}AS=\\Lambda$ diagonal. Columns of $S$ are an eigenvector basis; their order matches the eigenvalues on the diagonal.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**对角化**\n\n选到特征向量基，矩阵作用就变成各坐标独立伸缩；基向量顺序与对角特征值配对。",
      "x": 1740,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[可对角化判据|Diagonalizability criterion]]\n\nIn the chosen field, all eigenspaces together must supply a basis: their dimensions sum to the matrix size. Repeated eigenvalues can still supply enough directions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**可对角化判据**\n\n在当前域中，全部特征空间的维数总和须达到矩阵尺寸；重复特征值仍可能提供足够独立方向。",
      "x": 2120,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig008",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[重根对角化条件|Diagonalizability with repeated roots]]\n\nFirst require the characteristic polynomial to split in the chosen field. Then diagonalizability is equivalent to geometric and algebraic multiplicities matching at every root.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**重根对角化条件**\n\n先确认在当前域完全分裂，再逐个核对几何重数等于代数重数；出现重根本身不妨碍对角化。",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 510,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig010",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[对角化计算矩阵幂|Powers by diagonalization]]\n\nFor $A=S\\Lambda S^{-1}$ and integers $k\\ge0$, $A^k=S\\Lambda^kS^{-1}$. Keep eigenvalues paired with basis columns. The zeroth power is $I$; negative powers require invertibility.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**对角化计算矩阵幂**\n\n各特征坐标分别取幂，再换回原坐标；列与特征值须配对，零次幂为单位矩阵，负次幂要求可逆。",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig009",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[对角化与行化简|Diagonalization and row reduction]]\n\nSimilarity changes input and output to the same new basis. Row reduction recombines equations and their right-hand sides, preserving the solution set but not generally the spectrum.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**对角化与行化简**\n\n前者同时换输入、输出坐标；后者同步改写方程及右端以保留解集，一般不保留特征值。",
      "x": 2880,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig030",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[广义特征向量|Generalized eigenvector]]\n\nA nonzero $v$ satisfies $(A-\\lambda I)^kv=0$ for some positive integer $k$. The smallest such $k$ records its level.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**广义特征向量**\n\n非零向量经若干次 $A-\\lambda I$ 作用后归零；最小正整数次数记录它的阶。",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig012",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Jordan链|Jordan chain]]\n\nWith $v_1\\ne0$, require $(A-\\lambda I)v_1=0$ and $(A-\\lambda I)v_{j+1}=v_j$. The order fixes each step toward the first vector.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Jordan 链**\n\n链首非零，后一个向量作用后恰好得到前一个；排列须符合这组递推关系。",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig045",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Jordan链向量线性无关|Independence within a Jordan chain]]\n\nApplying powers of the shifted map isolates the last nonzero coefficient. One chain is independent; several chains still need a joint check.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**同一条链的线性无关性**\n\n对线性关系施加移位算子的幂，可隔离末尾非零系数。多条链还须检查联合无关。",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 1770,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig031",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Jordan块|Jordan block]]\n\n$J_r(\\lambda)=\\lambda I+N$: diagonal $\\lambda$, superdiagonal 1. One block, one chain; $N^r=0$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Jordan 块**\n\n对角线 $\\lambda$、超对角线1。每块一条链，$N^r=0$。",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig033",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Jordan标准形|Jordan canonical form]]\n\nThe chains together must form a basis of the whole space to give a block diagonal matrix. Each block contributes one ordinary eigenvector direction.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Jordan 标准形**\n\n全部链须共同组成全空间的基，才能得到块对角表示；每个块贡献一个普通特征方向。",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig014",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Jordan标准形的域条件|Field condition for Jordan form]]\n\nOrdinary Jordan form over a field exists exactly when the whole characteristic polynomial splits into linear factors there. The basis change uses that same field.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Jordan 标准形的域条件**\n\n整个特征多项式须在当前域分解成一次因子；换基矩阵也使用同一域。",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig013",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Jordan块的幂|Powers of a Jordan block]]\n\nFor nonnegative integer powers, the commuting scalar and shift parts give an exact finite binomial sum. Treat the zeroth power as the identity.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Jordan 块的幂**\n\n非负整数次幂由可交换的标量部分与移位部分作有限二项展开；零次幂是单位矩阵。",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 1770,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig034",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Jordan形唯一性|Uniqueness of Jordan form]]\n\nFor each eigenvalue, successive nullspace dimensions recover every block size and repetition. Whole-block order and the individual chain vectors can vary.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Jordan 形的唯一性**\n\n对每个特征值，连续核维数恢复块尺寸和重数；整块排列及链向量本身可变。",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 1770,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig029",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[对角化计算矩阵指数|Computing the exponential by diagonalization]]\n\nIf $A=S\\Lambda S^{-1}$, then $e^{tA}=S e^{t\\Lambda}S^{-1}$. Exponentiate the diagonal eigenvalues, preserving their pairing with the columns of $S$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**对角化计算矩阵指数**\n\n先转到特征坐标，各坐标乘对应指数，再换回；列与特征值的配对保持不变。",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 2110,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig011",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩阵指数|Matrix exponential]]\n\n$e^{tA}=\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}t^kA^k/k!$. The series converges for every finite square matrix. Powers use matrix multiplication; diagonalization is unnecessary.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**矩阵指数**\n\n对所有有限方阵，矩阵幂的指数级数都收敛；幂按矩阵乘法计算，定义不要求可对角化。",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": 2110,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig032",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Jordan块的指数|Exponential of a Jordan block]]\n\n$e^{tJ}=e^{\\lambda t}\\sum_{j=0}^{r-1}t^jN^j/j!$. Nilpotence makes the finite polynomial exact. An unbounded matrix family can still leave some initial trajectories bounded.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Jordan 块的矩阵指数**\n\n幂零性使有限多项式精确成立；矩阵族无界也允许某些初始轨迹有界。",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 2110,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig035",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Schur分解|Schur decomposition]]\n\nA unitary change of basis makes a complex square matrix upper triangular. Over the reals, an orthogonal change may leave 2×2 diagonal blocks. The basis vectors need not all be eigenvectors.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Schur 分解**\n\n复数域酉相似为上三角；实数域正交相似可保留2×2对角块。各列不必都是特征向量。",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 2490,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig044",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Schur分解存在性|Existence of Schur form]]\n\nChoose a unit eigenvector, complete an orthonormal basis, and recurse on the smaller compressed block. Real matrices may first need a two-dimensional invariant plane.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Schur 分解的存在性**\n\n取单位特征向量、补全标准正交基，再递归处理较小压缩块；实数情形可能先取二维不变平面。",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 2490,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig015",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Jordan、Schur与SVD用途边界|Jordan, Schur and SVD]]\n\nJordan describes exact similarity classes; Schur organizes eigenvalue computation; SVD pairs input/output stretches. Real Schur uses 1×1 or 2×2 blocks; stable algorithms can face sensitive objects.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**三种分解的用途**\n\nJordan 描述精确相似类，Schur 组织特征值计算，SVD 配对输入输出伸缩。实 Schur 保留1×1或2×2块；不把数值稳定算法等同于对象本身不敏感。",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 2490,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig036",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[谱半径|Spectral radius]]\n\n$\\rho(A)=\\max_{\\lambda\\in\\sigma(A)}|\\lambda|$ uses all complex eigenvalues, even for real $A$. It is not the largest one-step length gain.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**谱半径**\n\n全部复特征值的模取最大值，实矩阵也要计复根；它不是向量单次长度放大的最大倍数。",
      "x": 2190,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig016",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩阵幂趋零判据|When powers vanish]]\n\nFor a finite real or complex square matrix, $A^k\\to0$ exactly when $\\rho(A)<1$. Diagonalization is unnecessary: decay also overcomes the polynomial factors in Jordan blocks.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**矩阵幂趋零判据**\n\n有限实或复方阵的幂趋零，恰好对应谱半径严格小于一；不要求可对角化，指数衰减能压过 Jordan 多项式因子。",
      "x": 2570,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig018",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[离散系统谱稳定性|Discrete asymptotic stability]]\n\nFor fixed homogeneous $x_{k+1}=Ax_k$, zero is asymptotically stable exactly when every complex eigenvalue has $|\\lambda|<1$. Every initial state then tends to zero.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**离散系统渐近稳定**\n\n固定齐次系统要求全部特征值严格在单位圆内；此时每个初值都趋零，并满足小扰动始终保持小。",
      "x": 2950,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig037",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[离散系统有界判据|Bounded discrete trajectories]]\n\nFor fixed $x_{k+1}=Ax_k$, all trajectories are bounded iff all $|\\lambda|\\le1$ and unit-circle eigenvalues are semisimple. Bounded motion need not decay.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**离散系统有界判据**\n\n固定齐次离散系统：全部模不超过一，且单位圆上特征值半单，恰好保证全轨迹有界；有界不必趋零。",
      "x": 3330,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig047",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[常系数线性系统的矩阵指数解|Matrix-exponential solution]]\n\nFor constant $A$, $u(t)=e^{tA}u_0$ uniquely solves $u'=Au$, $u(0)=u_0$. Check the equation and initial value, then prove uniqueness using $e^{-tA}$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**常系数系统的矩阵指数解**\n\n先验方程与初值，再用 $e^{-tA}$ 证明唯一性；常矩阵与齐次方程是前提。",
      "x": 2190,
      "y": 1770,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bridge-exp-solution",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n**Solution operator**\n\nDifferentiate the series and apply it to the initial vector.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**解算子**\n\n对级数求导，再作用于初值。",
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 2110,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig019",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[连续系统谱稳定性|Continuous asymptotic stability]]\n\nFor fixed homogeneous $x'=Ax$, zero is asymptotically stable exactly when every eigenvalue has $\\operatorname{Re}\\lambda<0$. Negative real parts permit decaying oscillations.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**连续系统渐近稳定**\n\n固定齐次系统要求全部特征值实部严格为负；可以伴有衰减振荡，每个初值都趋零。",
      "x": 2570,
      "y": 1770,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig038",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[连续系统有界判据|Bounded continuous trajectories]]\n\nFor fixed $x'=Ax$ and $t\\ge0$, all trajectories are bounded iff all real parts are nonpositive and imaginary-axis eigenvalues are semisimple.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**连续系统有界判据**\n\n固定齐次连续系统，向前时间：全部实部非正，且虚轴特征值半单，恰好保证全轨迹有界。",
      "x": 2950,
      "y": 1770,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig017",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[非正规矩阵瞬态|Nonnormal transient growth]]\n\nEven when $\\rho(A)<1$, a nonnormal matrix can amplify a state before it decays. The standard Euclidean norm and initial direction matter; nonnormality alone does not force growth.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**非正规矩阵瞬态**\n\n最终衰减前可能暂时放大；须明确标准欧氏长度和初始方向。非正规允许放大，但不保证发生。",
      "x": 2570,
      "y": 2110,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig020",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[单轨迹与系统稳定性|One path versus the system]]\n\nA growing direction can be absent from the initial state or hidden from the measured output. One decaying trajectory generally cannot certify all initial directions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**单轨迹与系统稳定性**\n\n增长方向可能未被初值激活，也可能被测量遗漏；一条衰减轨迹通常不足以认证全部初值。",
      "x": 2950,
      "y": 2110,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig039",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Markov矩阵|Markov matrices]]\n\nNonnegative entries and unit column or row sums encode a finite transition rule. A probability vector has nonnegative entries totaling one.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Markov矩阵**\n\n非负条目及列和或行和为一，编码有限状态转移；概率向量还须非负且总和一。",
      "x": 2190,
      "y": 2780,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig021",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Markov矩阵左右约定|Row and column conventions]]\n\nColumn convention: $x_{k+1}=Px_k$. For the same transitions, $R=P^T$ and probability rows obey $p_{k+1}=p_kR$. Transpose both descriptions together.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Markov矩阵左右约定**\n\n列约定左乘概率列；同一转移的行约定使用转置矩阵，概率行从左边乘它。两者须一起转换。",
      "x": 2570,
      "y": 2780,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig046",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Markov矩阵必有特征值一|Eigenvalue one]]\n\nUnit row sums directly give $P\\mathbf1=\\mathbf1$. Unit column sums give the left equation; the transpose has the same characteristic polynomial.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Markov矩阵必有特征值一**\n\n行和一直接给全一右向量；列和一先给左方程，再借转置同特征多项式证明有根一。",
      "x": 2190,
      "y": 3150,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig040",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Markov矩阵谱边界|The stochastic spectral bound]]\n\nAll complex eigenvalues satisfy $|\\lambda|\\le1$, and $\\rho(P)=1$. Powers remain bounded in the column one-norm or row infinity-norm; boundary oscillations are allowed.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Markov矩阵谱边界**\n\n全部复特征值位于闭单位圆，谱半径恰为一；相应范数下幂有界，仍可有边界振荡。",
      "x": 2570,
      "y": 3150,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig049",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Markov单位圆特征值半单|Semisimple boundary modes]]\n\nUniformly bounded powers exclude a Jordan chain longer than one at $|\\lambda|=1$. Repeated boundary roots remain possible; interior Jordan blocks may be larger.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Markov单位圆特征值半单**\n\n一致有界的幂排除单位圆上的长链；仍允许边界重根，圆内也可有较大 Jordan 块。",
      "x": 2950,
      "y": 3150,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig022",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Markov稳态分布|Stationary distributions]]\n\nUnder the column convention, $P\\pi=\\pi$ together with $\\pi_i\\ge0$ and total mass one. The distribution stays fixed while individual states can move.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Markov稳态分布**\n\n列约定下同时满足固定点方程、非负性及总和一；概率分布不变，具体状态仍可移动。",
      "x": 2950,
      "y": 2780,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig042",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Markov矩阵幂收敛判据|Convergence of Markov powers]]\n\nFinite stochastic $P^k$ converges iff $|\\lambda|<1$ for every $\\lambda\\ne1$. The value 1 may repeat; the limiting projection may have rank greater than one.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限随机矩阵：除数值1外全部特征值模小于1，恰好保证幂收敛。1可为重根，极限投影的秩可大于一。",
      "x": 2950,
      "y": 3520,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig048",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Markov幂的秩一稳态极限|A common stationary limit]]\n\nFor a finite column-stochastic matrix, convergent powers plus a unique stationary column $\\pi$ give $P^k\\to\\pi\\mathbf1^T$. Every probability column then has the same limit.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限列随机矩阵的幂收敛再加稳态唯一，列约定下才得到每列都是π的秩一极限；全部概率初值趋向同一分布。",
      "x": 3330,
      "y": 3520,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig041",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Markov稳态唯一判据|Stationary uniqueness]]\n\nFor finite column-stochastic $P$, uniqueness is equivalent to $\\dim\\ker(P-I)=1$, or exactly one closed class. Transient states are allowed.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限列随机矩阵：稳态唯一等价于固定空间一维，也等价于恰好一个闭类；允许暂态状态。",
      "x": 3710,
      "y": 3150,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig023",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[稳态唯一不推收敛|Uniqueness and oscillation]]\n\nThe two-state flip has one stationary distribution, but a point start alternates forever. Uniqueness does not remove the eigenvalue −1.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n两状态交换只有一个稳态，但单点初态永远交替；唯一性没有排除特征值−1。",
      "x": 3710,
      "y": 3520,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "invariant-subspace",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2870,
      "width": 690,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[不变子空间|Invariant subspace]]\n\n$T(W)\\subseteq W$: every vector in $W$ stays inside $W$ after the linear map. Individual vectors can move. Real Schur leading subspaces must end at complete blocks.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**不变子空间**\n\n作用后的向量仍留在同一子空间，不要求每个向量不动。实 Schur 的前若干列须取到完整块末尾。"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig050",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3330,
      "y": 1770,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[半单特征值|Semisimple eigenvalues]]\n\nFor one eigenvalue, algebraic multiplicity equals eigenspace dimension. Equivalently, all its Jordan blocks have size one. Repetition is allowed; the whole matrix need not be diagonalizable.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**半单特征值**\n\n对单个特征值，两类重数相等；等价于对应块全为一阶。允许重根，不代表整个矩阵可对角化。"
    },
    {
      "id": "eig051",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3330,
      "y": 2780,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[有限Markov链稳态存在|Existence of a stationary distribution]]\n\nEvery finite stochastic matrix has at least one probability fixed point. Averages have a convergent subsequence whose limit is fixed; individual distributions need not converge.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**有限Markov链稳态存在**\n\n每个有限随机矩阵至少有一个概率固定点；分布平均的收敛子序列给出它，不要求单时刻分布收敛。"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
