      "toNode": "eig005",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Count algebraic multiplicity · 按代数重数计数"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge007",
      "fromNode": "eig006",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "eig025",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Determinant factors cancel under similarity · 相似变换中的行列式因子相消"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge008",
      "fromNode": "eig006",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "eig043",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "The inverse basis change transports eigenvectors · 逆换基把特征向量送到对应特征空间"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge009",
      "fromNode": "eig025",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "eig026",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Equal characteristic polynomials do not determine similarity · 相同特征多项式不足以确定相似性"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge010",
      "fromNode": "eig043",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "eig026",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Unequal eigenspace dimensions rule out similarity · 特征空间维数不同即可排除相似"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge011",
      "fromNode": "eig006",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "eig028",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Choose a basis in which the same action is diagonal · 选择使同一作用成为对角形式的基"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge012",
      "fromNode": "eig028",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "eig007",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "An invertible eigenvector matrix is exactly a full eigenbasis · 可逆特征向量矩阵正好对应完整特征基"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge013",
      "fromNode": "eig007",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "eig008",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "After splitting, match both multiplicities at every root · 分裂后逐根核对两类重数相等"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge014",
      "fromNode": "eig007",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "eig010",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "An eigenbasis reduces repeated action to scalar powers · 特征基把反复作用化成标量幂"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge015",
      "fromNode": "eig028",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "eig009",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Compare basis change with equation row operations · 对照换基与方程行操作"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge016",
      "fromNode": "eig030",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "eig012",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Reverse the successive nonzero shifted images to obtain a chain · 将连续非零移位像反向排列成链"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge017",
      "fromNode": "eig012",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "eig031",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "The ordered chain basis represents one Jordan block · 有序链基表示一个 Jordan 块"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge042",
      "fromNode": "eig012",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "eig045",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "A nonzero chain head forces every coefficient to vanish · 链首非零迫使线性关系全部系数为零"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge018",
      "fromNode": "eig031",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "eig033",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "A full chain basis assembles the block diagonal form · 完整链基拼成块对角形式"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge019",
      "fromNode": "eig014",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "eig034",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "After existence, nullity increments determine block sizes · 存在以后用核维数增量确定块尺寸"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge020",
      "fromNode": "eig031",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "eig013",
      "toSide": "top",
